@ClaimsToolsServer_HostAddress = http://localhost:5050

# This is an MCP (Model Context Protocol) server, not a REST API - there's no plain GET endpoint
# to try here. Use an MCP inspector, or AgentCore.Agents' AgentToolsFactory (a real McpClient),
# to talk to it. See docs/plan-mcp.md.

### List tools (MCP JSON-RPC over Streamable HTTP)
POST {{ClaimsToolsServer_HostAddress}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "tools/list"
}

###
